# Environmental Lockdown Implementation Plan

Since both of these remaining threats (AWS Metadata Theft and Direct Disk Exhaustion) bypass the Node.js API (because they are executed directly through the container's bash terminal over the WebSocket), fixing them requires combining a Node-side watcher and an OS-level infrastructure script.

